  "description": "<p>This task is to identify and reconcile the variables and functions related to \"server-managed-triples\", SMTs.</p>\n\n<p>There are currently several such variables/functions that create a confusing picture of SMTs.</p>\n\n<p>...potentially including:</p>\n<ul class=\"alternate\" type=\"square\">\n\t<li><a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/blob/db4d802375580f2029be75036bb7f9ab6c0d776d/fcrepo-kernel-modeshape/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/kernel/modeshape/FedoraResourceImpl.java#L215\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/blob/db4d802375580f2029be75036bb7f9ab6c0d776d/fcrepo-kernel-modeshape/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/kernel/modeshape/FedoraResourceImpl.java#L215</a></li>\n\t<li><a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/blob/db4d802375580f2029be75036bb7f9ab6c0d776d/fcrepo-kernel-modeshape/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/kernel/modeshape/spring/ModeShapeRepositoryFactoryBean.java#L165\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/blob/db4d802375580f2029be75036bb7f9ab6c0d776d/fcrepo-kernel-modeshape/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/kernel/modeshape/spring/ModeShapeRepositoryFactoryBean.java#L165</a></li>\n\t<li><a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/blob/db4d802375580f2029be75036bb7f9ab6c0d776d/fcrepo-kernel-api/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/kernel/api/RequiredRdfContext.java#L48\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/blob/db4d802375580f2029be75036bb7f9ab6c0d776d/fcrepo-kernel-api/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/kernel/api/RequiredRdfContext.java#L48</a></li>\n\t<li><a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/blob/db4d802375580f2029be75036bb7f9ab6c0d776d/fcrepo-kernel-api/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/kernel/api/RdfLexicon.java#L139\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/blob/db4d802375580f2029be75036bb7f9ab6c0d776d/fcrepo-kernel-api/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/kernel/api/RdfLexicon.